{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"XinTaoFei.Codeg","latestVersion":"0.42.2","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Aggregate and browse AI coding agent sessions (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, etc.) in one place. Desktop app, self-hosted server, or Docker.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/spacering-net/codeg/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Aggregate and browse AI coding agent sessions (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, etc.) in one place. Desktop app, self-hosted server, or Docker.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/spacering-net/codeg/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Codeg (Code Generation) is an enterprise-grade multi-agent coding workspace. It unifies local AI coding agents (Claude Code, Codex CLI, OpenCode, Gemini CLI, OpenClaw, Cline, etc.) in a desktop app, standalone server, or Docker container — enabling remote development from any browser — with conversation aggregation, parallel git worktree development, MCP/Skills management, chat channel interactions (Telegram, Lark, iLink, etc.), and integrated Git/file/terminal workflows.","name":"codeg","packageUrl":"https://github.com/spacering-net/codeg","publisher":"codeg","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/spacering-net/codeg/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/spacering-net","releaseNotes":"This release adds support for Claude Fable 5.2, updates Codex and several other agents, and fixes Qoder failing to start on Windows and MiniMax questions not showing as cards.\nImproved\n- Claude Code is updated to 2.1.321 with adapter 0.102.0, so the Fable model is now Fable 5.2, and a saved Fable 5.1 selection through an API gateway switches to Fable 5.2 automatically instead of falling back to the default model.\n- Codex is updated to adapter 2.6.0 (Codex 0.166.0), and its async questions now display as answer cards that stay in sync during the conversation and in history.\n- Grok background sub-agents show live progress after the turn that launched them ends. (#1109)\n- Updated OpenCode to 2.2.6, CodeBuddy to 2.182.0, Qoder to 1.1.86, the ZCode bridge to 0.82.3 and Command Code to 1.88.5.\nFixed\n- Qoder starts normally again on Windows, and its diagnostics show the actual program being launched or the reason it could not be found. (#1101 by @leehom0123)\n- MiniMax questions to the user appear as interactive question cards instead of raw JSON, including each option's description. (#1111 by @xy3xy3)\n- When a Codex conversation's model provider no longer matches, codeg shows a clear notice instead of silently starting an empty session that loses the history.\n- Reopened Claude Code context compaction summaries no longer include internal prompt text meant for the model.\n- OpenCode 2.2.6 conversation history displays its complete content.\nThanks to @leehom0123 (#1101) and @xy3xy3 (#1111) for their contributions, and to @momomomo820 (#1109) for the report.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/spacering-net/codeg/releases/tag/v0.42.2","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","claude-code","code","codex","coding","gemini-cli","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"在一个地方聚合并浏览 AI 编程代理会话（如 Claude Code、Codex、Gemini CLI 等）。支持桌面应用、自建服务器或 Docker 部署。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Codeg（Code Generation，代码生成）是一款企业级多代理编码工作区。它将本地 AI 编程代理（包括 Claude Code、Codex CLI、OpenCode、Gemini CLI、OpenClaw、Cline 等）统一集成于桌面应用、独立服务器或 Docker 容器中，支持通过任意浏览器进行远程开发；具备对话聚合、并行 Git 工作树开发、MCP/技能管理、聊天频道交互（Telegram、飞书、iLink 等），以及集成的 Git/文件/终端工作流。","releaseNotes":"这一版支持 Claude Fable 5.2，更新 Codex 及多个智能体，并修复 Qoder 在 Windows 上无法启动、MiniMax 提问不弹出卡片等问题。\n改进\n- Claude Code 更新至 2.1.321，适配器更新至 0.102.0，Fable 模型升级为 Fable 5.2，通过 API 网关使用时，已保存的 Fable 5.1 选择会自动切换到 Fable 5.2，不再回落到默认模型。\n- Codex 适配器更新至 2.6.0（Codex 0.166.0），异步提问会显示为答题卡片，会话中和历史记录里都能正确展示。\n- Grok 后台子智能体在启动它的回合结束后，仍会实时显示运行进度。（#1109）\n- OpenCode 更新至 2.2.6，CodeBuddy 更新至 2.182.0，Qoder 更新至 1.1.86，ZCode 桥接更新至 0.82.3，Command Code 更新至 1.88.5。\n修复\n- Qoder 在 Windows 上恢复正常启动，诊断信息也会显示实际启动的程序或无法找到的原因。（#1101 by @leehom0123）\n- MiniMax 向用户提问时会弹出可交互的提问卡片，不再只显示 JSON 参数，并展示每个选项的说明。（#1111 by @xy3xy3）\n- Codex 会话的模型供应商不再匹配时，会显示明确提示，不再悄悄新开一个空会话导致历史丢失。\n- 重新打开 Claude Code 的上下文压缩摘要时，不再显示写给模型的内部提示文本。\n- OpenCode 2.2.6 的历史会话能完整显示内容。\n感谢 @leehom0123（#1101）和 @xy3xy3（#1111）的贡献，以及 @momomomo820（#1109）的反馈。","tags":["claude-code","codex","gemini-cli","人工智能","代码","大语言模型","智能体","编程","聊天机器人","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"Codeg (Code Generation) is an enterprise-grade multi-agent coding workspace. It unifies local AI coding agents (Claude Code, Codex CLI, OpenCode, Gemini CLI, OpenClaw, Cline, etc.) in a desktop app, standalone server, or Docker container — enabling remote development from any browser — with conversation aggregation, parallel git worktree development, MCP/Skills management, chat channel interactions (Telegram, Lark, iLink, etc.), and integrated Git/file/terminal workflows.","name":"codeg","packageUrl":"https://github.com/spacering-net/codeg","publisher":"codeg","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/spacering-net/codeg/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/spacering-net","releaseNotes":"This release adds support for Claude Fable 5.2, updates Codex and several other agents, and fixes Qoder failing to start on Windows and MiniMax questions not showing as cards.\nImproved\n- Claude Code is updated to 2.1.321 with adapter 0.102.0, so the Fable model is now Fable 5.2, and a saved Fable 5.1 selection through an API gateway switches to Fable 5.2 automatically instead of falling back to the default model.\n- Codex is updated to adapter 2.6.0 (Codex 0.166.0), and its async questions now display as answer cards that stay in sync during the conversation and in history.\n- Grok background sub-agents show live progress after the turn that launched them ends. (#1109)\n- Updated OpenCode to 2.2.6, CodeBuddy to 2.182.0, Qoder to 1.1.86, the ZCode bridge to 0.82.3 and Command Code to 1.88.5.\nFixed\n- Qoder starts normally again on Windows, and its diagnostics show the actual program being launched or the reason it could not be found. (#1101 by @leehom0123)\n- MiniMax questions to the user appear as interactive question cards instead of raw JSON, including each option's description. (#1111 by @xy3xy3)\n- When a Codex conversation's model provider no longer matches, codeg shows a clear notice instead of silently starting an empty session that loses the history.\n- Reopened Claude Code context compaction summaries no longer include internal prompt text meant for the model.\n- OpenCode 2.2.6 conversation history displays its complete content.\nThanks to @leehom0123 (#1101) and @xy3xy3 (#1111) for their contributions, and to @momomomo820 (#1109) for the report.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/spacering-net/codeg/releases/tag/v0.42.2","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","claude-code","code","codex","coding","gemini-cli","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.42.2/app.json","detailSha256":"6f696ae982fa664afb03b8814e84ba6e383abd13f569078bc7207f6888534356","releaseDate":"2026-11-09","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"0.42.2"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.42.1/app.json","detailSha256":"103df5c3eb1208901574cfd37654379aa57e0b6e561747c856f2d10193d19778","releaseDate":"2026-11-07","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"0.42.1"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.42.0/app.json","detailSha256":"7931419a5d28a13651c090e55f1cb729ac81d6213edaad5f2ab5f136bbc5cb0a","releaseDate":"2026-11-03","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.42.0"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.41.4/app.json","detailSha256":"9ccbd97e83c6aabd1e9ee18e2e9158ff438f8e07b96f891372ddaf329975ad12","releaseDate":"2026-11-02","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.41.4"},{"architect